+## Deploy 3: Final Tidy Up (Prepared — Ready to Ship — Final)
+
+**Prerequisite met:** Deploy 1 and Deploy 2 have shipped to all servers and both Deploy 2 migrations (`20261122092000` and `20261122092100`) have completed on `consul_development`.
+
+### Safety Guarantees Verified
+- **Safe alongside Deploy 2 (zero downtime):** Deploy 3 contains **zero database migrations or data changes**. All columns whose `self.ignored_columns` declarations were removed were already dropped in Deploy 2, and all polymorphic/legacy rows guarded by Deploy 1 were already deleted in Deploy 2.
+- **Persistent backups preserved:** All 3 SQL dump files under `db/backups/citizen_proposals/` (`dropped_tables.sql`, `dropped_columns.sql`, `deleted_rows.sql`) remain untouched.
+- **Spanish locales preserved:** `config/locales/es/*` remains completely untouched for translators.
+- **`Legislation::Proposal` preserved:** All collaborative legislation proposal models, controllers, routes, views, components, shared settings (`proposal_code_prefix`, `max_votes_for_proposal_edit`), styles, and specs remain intact and passing.
+
+### 1. Removed All 6 `self.ignored_columns` Declarations
+- `app/models/map_location.rb` (`proposal_id`)
+- `app/models/poll/question.rb` (`proposal_id`)
+- `app/models/poll.rb` (`related_type`, `related_id`)
+- `config/initializers/acts_as_taggable_on.rb` (`proposals_count`)
+- `app/models/user.rb` (`recommended_proposals`, `email_digest`, `failed_email_digests_count`)
+- `app/models/notification.rb` (`emailed_at`)
+
+### 2. Removed All 20 Deploy-1 Transitional Guards
+1. `app/models/comment.rb`: removed `scope :without_removed_commentables`, `def commentable` override, and `"Proposal"` early returns in `after_hide`/`after_restore`.
+2. `app/controllers/admin/comments_controller.rb`: removed `.without_removed_commentables`.
+3. `app/controllers/admin/hidden_comments_controller.rb`: removed `.without_removed_commentables`.
+4. `app/controllers/moderation/comments_controller.rb`: removed `load_resources` override (inherits `ModerateActions#load_resources`).
+5. `app/controllers/admin/system_emails_controller.rb`: removed `.without_removed_commentables` in `load_sample_reply`.
+6. `app/controllers/admin/stats_controller.rb`: removed `.without_removed_commentables` on `@comments` and `.where.not(votable_type: "Proposal")` on `@votes`.
+7. `app/controllers/comments_controller.rb`: removed `@comment.commentable.nil?` transitional check in `show`.
+8. `app/models/notification.rb`: restored `scope :for_render` and removed `def notifiable` override.
+9. `app/controllers/notifications_controller.rb`: removed transitional `linkable_resource.nil? || !notifiable_available?` branch in `linkable_resource_path`.
+10. `app/models/activity.rb`: restored `scope :for_render` and removed `def actionable` override.
+11. `app/models/follow.rb`: removed `def followable` override.
+12. `app/models/user.rb`: removed `.where.not(votable_type: "Proposal")` in `take_votes_from` and `.where.not(followable_type: "Proposal")` in `interests`.
+13. `app/components/users/public_activity_component.rb`: removed `.where.not(followable_type: "Proposal")` in `follows` and `"Proposal"` from `disabled_commentables`.
+14. `app/models/concerns/relationable.rb`: removed `.where.not(child_relationable_type: "Proposal")` in `relationed_contents`.
+15. `app/models/concerns/sdg/related.rb`: removed `.where.not(relatable_type: "Proposal")` in `relatables`.
+16. `config/initializers/acts_as_taggable_on.rb`: removed `return if taggable_type == "Proposal"` in `Tagging#touch_taggable`, `increment_tag_custom_counter`, and `decrement_tag_custom_counter`.
+17. `lib/tasks/votes.rake`: removed `.where.not(votable_type: "Proposal")` in `remove_duplicate_votes`.
+18. `app/components/admin/banners/form_component.rb`: restored `WebSection.all` in `sections`.
+19. `app/controllers/admin/homepage_controller.rb`: restored `Widget::Feed.order(:created_at)` in `load_feeds`.
+20. `app/controllers/topics_controller.rb`: removed transitional `@community.investment.blank?` guard in `load_community`.
+
+### 3. Cleaned Up Remaining Leftover Citizen-Proposal Artifacts
+- **Machine Learning scripts:** Removed the 4 orphaned citizen-proposal scripts from `public/machine_learning/scripts/` (`proposals_related_content_and_tags_nmf.{py,ini}`, `proposals_summary_comments_textrank.{py,ini}`) so `/admin/machine_learning` only exposes active Participatory Budget scripts.
+- **Specs:** Removed obsolete `process.proposals` / `sdg.process.proposals` / `relatable_type: "proposals"` examples from `spec/controllers/sdg_management/relations_controller_spec.rb`.
+- **GraphQL:** Replaced the stale `# proposal_notifications` / `# proposalNotifications` comment in `app/graphql/types/base_object.rb` with `# comments_count` / `# commentsCount`.
+- **Linter config:** Removed stale excludes for deleted dashboard/digest views from `.erb_lint.yml`.
+- **Stylesheets:** Removed dead citizen-proposal / dashboard-only CSS selectors from `app/assets/stylesheets/admin/menu.scss`, `layout.scss`, `participation.scss`, `widgets/feeds/participation.scss`, `widgets/feeds/feed.scss`, and `shared/banner.scss` (preserving all `.proposal` / `.proposal-show` / `.proposal-new` / `.proposal-edit` rules used by `Legislation::Proposal`).
+- **English locales (`config/locales/en/*`):** Removed unused citizen-proposal / dashboard / proposal-notification / nested-link keys hidden behind dynamic `i18n-tasks` patterns from `admin.yml`, `general.yml`, `mailers.yml`, and `pages.yml` (while keeping all keys shared with `Legislation::Proposal`, `Budget::Investment`, and `MapLocation`, and leaving `config/locales/es/*` untouched).
+
+### 4. Final Audit & Verification Performed
+- **Database audit (`consul_development` & `db/schema.rb`):** Zero citizen-proposal tables, sequences, columns, indexes, foreign keys, polymorphic rows, settings, or web sections remain; `settings` (105 rows) matches `Setting.defaults` 100%; `web_sections` has 5 rows.
+- **Model & ActiveRecord verification:** Confirmed `ignored_columns == []` on all 6 previously-guarded models (`MapLocation`, `Poll::Question`, `Poll`, `ActsAsTaggableOn::Tag`/`Tag`, `User`, `Notification`) and ran a rolled-back CRUD write/read smoke test across `Debate`, `Comment`, `Vote`, `Notification`, `Activity`, `Poll`, `Poll::Question`, `Legislation::Process`, `Legislation::Proposal`, `Follow`, `Tag`, `Budget::Investment`, and `MapLocation`.
+- **Asset compilation & linters:** Verified Sprockets compilation of `application.css`, `application.js`, `print.css`, and `pdf_fonts.css`; verified `.erb_lint.yml` via `bundle exec erb_lint`; checked modified Ruby files with `bundle exec rubocop`.
+- **Live HTTP & GraphQL smoke tests against `consul_development`:** Verified 200 OK across public pages and 22 authenticated user/admin/moderation routes, 404 on 13 removed citizen-proposal routes, clean `/admin/machine_learning` scripts list, clean `/admin/banners/new` sections, and clean GraphQL schema & queries.
+- **Full test suite:** `bundle exec rspec` passed (`3,970 examples, 0 failures`), including `spec/i18n_spec.rb` (0 missing keys, 0 unused keys).
